I’m not sure if it is because of the stress or what, but I have been thinking about this a lot lately. It seems like everyone else is doing it and I don’t see why I shouldn’t either. I know that I am going to fail my exams anyway so why should I even bother studying? It would be much easier for me to just copy someone else’s work than try and do all of mine myself. Plus, then I wouldn’t have to worry about getting caught! I think that there are many reasons why people might consider cheating on their exams: - They feel like they can’t keep up with the material in class;
- They don’t understand how important these tests will be later down the line (college applications);
- Or maybe they just don’t care anymore…
